    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just quiet. it's empty. like there's no point in even getting out of bed anymore. everything i do feels like i'm just pretending to be alive. i just want to be where he is. i just want to stop feeling like this and be with him again. is that so wrong to want?",
