      "content": "it feels like the only truth is that i'm just waiting. waiting to feel something or waiting for it all to just... end. sometimes i sit here and wonder if there is actually a way to go to him. i just want to find peace. do you think there is actually any peace left for me here, or is it just meant to be like this forever?",
